# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. An origin-bound verb tolerates an absent
# stamped origin and trusts the body, so with binding off a caller pushes,
# exchanges a manifest or reads a cursor under any origin it names.
MODULE: ReceiverPushOriginHeaderOptional
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an origin-bound verb admits a call that carries no stamped origin

--- FIND
         ELSE IF hdr = NoHeader \/ hdr # body THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- REPLACE
         ELSE IF hdr # NoHeader /\ hdr # body THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- END